 "caption": "At x = 2 the curve y = 2x² − 5x + 1 is at (2, −1) with gradient 4x − 5 = 3. The normal is perpendicular to the tangent, with gradient −1/3, giving y = −x/3 − 1/3.",
 "alt": "The parabola y = 2x² − 5x + 1 with a tangent of gradient 3 and a perpendicular normal of gradient −1/3, both through the point (2, −1).",
